\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1-Rouble falls to one-year low on euro weakness  \b0\par\par\uc2 294 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 8 November 2005\par 09:47\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2005 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2  MOSCOW, Nov 8 (Reuters) - The Russian rouble fell below 28.84 to the dollar on Tuesday, its lowest since October 2004, as the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  surged to a 2-year high against the euro, dealers said.  \par \par \uc2  Roubles for "tomorrow" delivery <RUBUTSTN=MCX> fell 0.3 percent to 28.8501 at 0835 GMT at Moscow's MICEX exchange, but the Russian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was 0.4 percent stronger against the euro.  \par \par \uc2  Dealers said \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market and was unlikely to do so because the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket it uses to guide daily \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  -- made up of $0.65 and 0.35 euros -- was barely changed on the day.  \par \par \uc2  "The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  might take part in the session soon but I do not think it will start selling dollars to stop it from rising," said Artyom Roshchin at Alba Alliance.  \par \par \uc2  "The rouble is weakening in line with the euro-dollar market, we just have a mirror image of this trend here. There is no conspiracy behind it."  \par \par \uc2  The dollar was buoyed on international markets by its widening yield advantage against overseas markets, repatriation of funds by U.S. companies to take advantage of a tax break and continuing urban riots in France.  \par \par \uc2  The rouble has shed over 3 percent in value against the dollar so far this year, but has rallied by 11 percent against the ailing euro.  \par \par \uc2  That has made it easier for the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to mitigate the inflationary impact of high prices for oil while keeping the rouble's exchange rate against the greenback -- closely watched by ordinary Russians -- relatively stable.     \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-RUSSIA-ROUBLE (UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|ABN|M|E|RBN|D|RNP  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020051108e1b8000sz\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
