\par\par \b \uc2 Russian rouble climbs vs dlr after euro rallies  \b0\par\par\uc2 268 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 12 Juli 2005\par 12:15\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2005 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 MOSCOW, July 12 (Reuters) - The Russian rouble climbed to two-week highs against the dollar on Tuesday, taking heart from the euro's rally against the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , dealers said.  \par \par \uc2 The rouble largely shadows moves on global markets after the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  introduced a dual \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket to guide day-to-day trade earlier this year.  \par \par \uc2 "There is some anxiety that the euro could rise today to $1.2200-$1.2205, then the dollar will fall here -- to somewhere around 28.56-28.57 roubles," one dealer said.  \par \par \uc2 By 1000 GMT roubles for "tomorrow" delivery <RUBUTSTN=MCX> were up 0.4 percent from the previous session's fix at 28.5900, peaking earlier at 28.57, their strongest since late June.  \par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, the euro <EUR=> had risen to a three-week high against the dollar as investors scrambled to cover positions following its sharp fall this month, before potentially dollar-negative U.S. data this week.  \par \par \uc2 Traders said the Russian \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  could well appear on the market to offer to buy dollars, in line with its policy of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  to smooth out any sharp fluctuation in trade.  \par \par \uc2 With the euro at around $1.2180, dealers suggested the bank might be ready to buy U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  at 28.58-28.59 roubles.  \par \par \uc2 Last year the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would defend one particular level for weeks at a time, but now dealers are far less likely to agree when and where the bank is \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-\b \highlight22\uc2 RUSSIA\b0 \highlight\uc2 -ROUBLE|LANGEN|ABN|M|D|RBN|RNP|DNP|PTD|PMF  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020050712e17c000tu\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
