\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2  basket allows  \highlight22\uc2 Russia \highlight\uc2  cbank to cut  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 379 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 14 Juni 2005\par 15:00\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2005 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 MOSCOW, June 14 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  reduced its \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  by nearly a third month-on-month in May, it said on Tuesday, aided by its dual \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket.  \par \par \uc2 Russia launched the basket earlier this year to guide the rouble day-to-day, providing the market with a good idea of where the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  wants the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to trade at any given euro/dollar rate <EUR=>.  \par \par \uc2 "The Bank of Russia's use of a dual \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket ... has contributed to a lowering in the volume of Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the domestic \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market by 30 percent compared to the previous month to $4.27 billion," it said in a monthly report.  \par \par \uc2 The basket is currently made up of $0.7 and 0.3 euros.  \par \par \uc2 It also confirmed that the main factor driving the Russian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  last month had been "the strengthening of the U.S. dollar on world \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets".  \par \par \uc2 The rouble has tracked moves on global markets doggedly so far this year, meaning that Monday's nine-month low for the single \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  against the dollar sent the Russian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  <RUBUTSTN=MCX> to its weakest since mid-November on Tuesday.  \par \par \uc2 Monday was a market holiday in \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 When the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  to buy dollars it pumps roubles into the economy, which has played a role in frustrating Russia's attempts to cut inflation, which a Reuters poll sees dipping to 11.5 percent this year from 2004's 11.7 percent.  \par \par \uc2 Although printing fewer roubles may have a positive impact on inflation, the report said banking sector liquidity declined in May.  \par \par \uc2 "The main factor ... was that the rate funds were accumulated on budget accounts in the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2 , including the stabilisation fund, outstripped the volume of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the domestic market," it said.  \par \par \uc2 Overnight rates on the interbank market <RUBOND=>, which were hovering around 1-2 percent at the start of this year, are now around 5 percent.  \par \par \uc2 That is still well below levels of over 20 percent that short-term rates hit last summer, when the closure of two small banks triggered a run on deposits.  \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-RUSSIA-ROUBLE|LANGEN|ABN|M|D  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020050614e16e00150\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
