\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1-Russian rouble at highest since Jan 01 on weak dlr.   \b0\par\par\uc2 450 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 November 2004\par 09:31\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2  MOSCOW, Nov 26 (Reuters) - The Russian rouble jumped 0.2 percent on Friday to hit its highest against the dollar since early January 2001, with no sign of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  to stem its rise, dealers said.    \par \par \uc2  This is third session where the rouble has scored sharp gains after the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which runs a "dirty float" of the Russian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , made it clear on Tuesday that it would not resist moves on global \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets.    \par \par \uc2  On Friday the dollar fell to a record low against the euro as traders seized on a report that China has pared its U.S. Treasury bond holdings.    \par \par \uc2  "(The rise in the rouble) is connected to the rise in the euro against the dollar. Recently the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has reacted quickly to euro-dollar moves," one dealer said.    \par \par \uc2  By 0810 GMT roubles for "tomorrow" delivery  had peaked at 28.2500 to the dollar on the Moscow Interbank \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  Exchange having been fixed at 28.3205 the previous session.    \par \par \uc2  First Deputy Chairman Alexei Ulyukayev said on Thursday that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would not withdraw entirely from the market for some time, however, as it needs to smooth out the rouble's moves to preserve Russia's economic competitiveness.    \par \par \uc2  "In the end we mean to move to a regime with a free-floating national \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  - to leave the market, not to acquire a mass of hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  - but maybe we cannot do that, let us say at least not for the next year," Ulyukayev told a parliamentary committee.    \par \par \uc2  Data on Thursday showed that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's gold and \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves rose to a record $113.9 billion - equalling Russia's public foreign debt.    \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is taking out much of the country's petrodollar inflows with \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but analysts note that the need to do that may abate over time as Russia switches an oil-funded budget stabilisation fund into hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 .    \par \par \uc2  At the moment, the fund - set to top 500 billion roubles ($17.5 billion) this year - is held in interest-bearing rouble accounts, but the government will move the cash into top-rated investments in dollars, euros and sterling in early 2005.    \par \par \uc2  That, in turn, could reduce the pressure on the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to accumulate \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves and enable it to reduce its \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market as it focuses on debt reduction, said Rory MacFarquhar of Goldman Sachs in a note.    \par \par \uc2  "Once the fund has been moved offshore, its purchases of \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  will be more or less automatic, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's discretionary \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  will be much lower and more balanced," MacFarquhar said.    \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020041126e0bq006y2\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
