\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1-Russia cbank reserves jump to new record high.  \b0\par\par\uc2 248 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 14 Oktober 2004\par 09:42\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 MOSCOW, Oct 14 (Reuters) - Russia's gold and \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves jumped $3 billion in one week to hit a new all-time high on the back of record global oil prices, \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  figures showed on Thursday.  \par \par \uc2 Reserves rose to $98.3 billion on Oct. 8 from $95.3 billion on Oct. 1, the biggest one-week gain since February.  \par \par \uc2 "The trade surplus Russia is running is absolutely enormous. Oil prices are going off the scale," said Renaissance Capital economist Alexei Moisseev.  \par \par \uc2 Russia posted its highest monthly trade surplus in August in official data going back to 1998. Exports reached $16.2 billion - as much as Russia exported during an entire quarter while it climbed out of that year's economic slump.  \par \par \uc2 Russia's "rain-day" oil fund sterilises some of these inflows, helping combat inflationary pressure, Moisseev added. Russia's monetary base - although trending upwards - has not been rising at the same pace as \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves.  \par \par \uc2 But Russia's bulging current account puts upward pressure on the rouble which the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  combats by buying up dollars.  \par \par \uc2 "Clearly under these oil prices pressure on the rouble has increased. During this period the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was active in the market buying dollars," said Aton brokerage chief economist Peter Westin.  \par \par \uc2 Analysts are warning that continued \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  threatens \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's ability to control price growth, which they forecast will overshoot the government's 10 percent target this year.   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020041014e0ae004xx\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
