\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1-Russia c.bank warns rouble speculators of losses.   \b0\par\par\uc2 241 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 12 Oktober 2004\par 10:30\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 (repeats to make clear Korishchenko's title)   \par \par \uc2 MOSCOW, Oct 12 (Reuters) - Russia's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , defending its policy of stabilising the rouble, warned \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market players on Tuesday against trying to speculate on moves in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .   \par \par \uc2 "Any speculation, on either a rise or fall in the dollar or rouble ... may have highly painful consequences for those who take part in these \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Deputy Chairman Konstantin Korishchenko told Reuters.   \par \par \uc2 Korishchenko was speaking after the rouble rose to 3-month highs on Monday after dealers said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  retreated from a dollar \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  bid, fuelling market talk that the rouble may appreciate further.   \par \par \uc2 "It is one thing to study the broad economic picture, and to try and forecast the behaviour of the government and the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 . It is another matter to try and open major positions on one side (of the market) or the other," he said.   \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  runs a heavily-managed "dirty" float of the rouble, \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  to buy up \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  earnings on \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's record oil exports, in a policy analysts say may lead it to miss its 10 percent inflation target this year.   \par \par \uc2 Korishchenko declined to comment on \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy after dealers said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had re-entered the market on Tuesday with a dollar bid of 29.1150 roubles, down from its long-held earlier bid of 29.2150.    \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020041012e0ac00712\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
