\par\par \b \uc2 Russia cbank to target rouble against dlr/euro basket.   \b0\par\par\uc2 286 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 April 2004\par 15:35\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 MOSCOW, April 13 (Reuters) - Russia's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will overhaul its managed float of the rouble by replacing its exclusively dollar-based monitoring with a dollar/euro \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket, Deputy Chairman Konstantin Korishchenko said on Tuesday.   \par \par \uc2 The euro would represent 10 to 20 percent of the basket, Korishchenko told reporters at an investment conference, but its weight would gradually rise to 50 percent.   \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is currently the main player on \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  exchanges, \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  when it thinks the market is too volatile or to guide rouble/dollar rates towards annual targets.   \par \par \uc2 "Currently the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sets its goals in 'dollar to rouble' terms," Korishchenko said.   \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  uses a basket of \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  for statistical purposes, but has until now preferred to base its actions on the rouble's rate against the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  alone.   \par \par \uc2 Korishchenko said the new basket would be introduced after the merger in May of the interbank market and a joint trading session of eight exchanges.   \par \par \uc2 The rate that emerges from the exchanges' joint trading session currently serves as the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's official rouble/dollar exchange rate for the following day.   \par \par \uc2 The introduction of the basket would make it more difficult for dealers to see the rate at which the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Korishchenko said, and could lead to a higher market volatility.   \par \par \uc2 "The steps we are going to take mean less \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  influence on the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market and make it easier for the market to find the balance itself," he told the conference.   \par \par \uc2 The bank was considering whether it would carry out \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  in euros as well as dollars after introducing the basket, Korishchenko added.    \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020040413e04d001tx\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
