lationary consequences of its \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 ."   \par \par \uc2 Moody's Investor Service awarded \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2  an investment grade in early October, which opened doors to more foreign investment into the country. Strong prices for Russia's main exports, oil and gas, also increase the inflow of hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .    \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020031021dzal0025s\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
