\par\par \b \uc2  Russian rouble slips as liquidity squeeze eases. \b0\par\par\uc2 374 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 22 Januar 2003\par 14:03\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2003 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  MOSCOW, Jan 22 (Reuters) - The rouble slid against the dollar on Wednesday as a liquidity crunch eased and \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  for the second day running to soak up the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The rouble fell 0.92 kopecks over the morning in the unified session of eight exchanges and reached a weighted average for settlement today of 31.8095 compared to 31.8003 on Tuesday when it rose 2.21 kopecks. \par \par \uc2  "Liquidity has improved but one could still feel the shortage of roubles. That keeps lending rates high and holds the market (dollar) from bigger gains," Alexei Bukleyev at Alfa Bank said. \par \par \uc2  Improved sector liquidity trimmed interbank credit rates to 5/10 percent by 1215 GMT from over 20 percent in the previous session. The rise was sparked when oil producers Sibneft (SIBN.RTS) and TNK took some 59 billion roubles from the market to pay for a rival firm being sold by the state. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said that \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  helped to alleviate the rouble deficit. It has bought some $300 million from the market at 31.80 roubles since Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  But they added that the rouble supply was still tight because of government and Moscow city rouble-denominated bond placements and pending quarterly tax payments by large firms, such as gas giant Gazprom. \par \par \uc2  "Large taxpayers have a special schedule of tax payments and according to our observations make the largest part of payments at the end of January, April, July and October," ING said in a research note. \par \par \uc2  Dealers ruled out that rouble gains over the next few sessions as the upside seemed to be protected by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  at 31.80. They suggested it could nudge lower after a return of fresh funds from the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's deposits on Thursday. \par \par \uc2  "The rates are falling and that could generate higher demand for dollars," Andrei Lisyev at Dialog Optim bank said. \par \par \uc2  Low overnight rates usually indicate better sector liquidity and trigger the rouble's downturn against the greenback. \par \par \uc2  On the interbank market, another floor for foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  trade, roubles for delivery Thursday  were quoted at 31.8090/31.8175 at 1215 GMT, barely changed compared to Tuesday's close. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020030122dz1m00oox\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
