\par\par \b \uc2  UPDATE 1-Russian cbank dlr sales hold rouble steady. \b0\par\par\uc2 307 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 1 November 2002\par 12:04\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2002 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  MOSCOW, Nov 1 (Reuters) - The Russian rouble was barely changed against the dollar on Friday but dealers expected the national \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to resume its slide once the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  stopped dollar sales. \par \par \uc2  In the unified trading session of eight exchanges, used to set the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's official next-day rouble/dollar rate, the rouble nudged higher to a weighted average for today settlement of 31.7646 against the dollar from 31.7701 on Thursday. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the rouble was supported by \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  from the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  which tightly controls \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market. \par \par \uc2  The bank has been propping up the national \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  with dollar sales at 31.7850 for the second day, after rouble demand waned when local firms completed their tax payments on Thursday. \par \par \uc2  "Banks have no arguments to change the exchange rate views of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which has $46.4 billion in reserves at its disposal," Artyom Roshchin at Aljba-Alliance said. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  may have sold at least $50 million to soak up excessive rouble supply, sending overnight credit rates tumbling. \par \par \uc2  By 1030 GMT overnight rates dropped to 1.0/3.0 percent from over 20 percent earlier this week. Banks' balances on their correspondent accounts at the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  rose to 103.35 billion roubles from 86.31 billion roubles the previous session. \par \par \uc2  "Looking back on the actions of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , it seems that it favours a gradual depreciation of the rouble by 10 kopecks a month," a foreign bank dealer said. \par \par \uc2  "We will stay at this level as long as the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  backs the rouble," he added. \par \par \uc2  On the interbank market, another forum for foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  trade, roubles for tomorrow delivery traded at 31.7875/31.7900 a dollar at 1030 GMT unchanged from Thursday. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020021101dyb100l5c\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
