\par\par \b \uc2  UPDATE 1-Russian rouble slides amid dollar demand. \b0\par\par\uc2 373 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 1 April 2002\par 13:18\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2002 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  MOSCOW, April 1 (Reuters) - The Russian rouble fell against the dollar on Monday as end-of-the-quarter rouble deficit was over and the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  moved fast to send a notice it will not allow it to fall beyond 31.20 for now. \par \par \uc2  "The overnight rouble rates eased and the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  started offering dollars for tomorrow delivery at 31.20," said Mikhail Mikhalyov, the head of the foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  department at Zenit Bank. \par \par \uc2  The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2  regulates rouble supply through \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  rather than rates. It holds a tight grip on local foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  exchange market and immediately steps in when there is need to stamp out volatility. \par \par \uc2  In the unified trading session of eight exchanges, which usually serves as the basis for the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's next day rouble/dollar rate the rouble eased to a weighted average for today's settlement of 31.1741 from 31.1192 on Friday. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  fixed the official exchanged rate for Tuesday at that level, 31.1741 to the dollar. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  traded within a band of 31.1650-31.1800, with the last deal clinched at 31.1765. Deals worth $64.4 million were registered. \par \par \uc2  "The rouble broke through 31.20 early but the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  came out offering dollars at 31.20 (for today settlement) on interbank market. It gave a signal to the market as to what the level would be for now," said Artyom Roshchin, a trader with Aljba Alliance Bank. \par \par \uc2  On the interbank market, another forum in \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  trade, the rouble for next day delivery stood at 31.1940/31.2040 a dollar at 1030 GMT, versus 31.1995 at Friday's close. \par \par \uc2  Dealers saw the rouble easing slightly on Tuesday as grabbing dollars while overnight rates remained low looked attractive. They expected no abrupt rouble fall. \par \par \uc2  "I don't think that (dollar) quotes will go much higher during the rest of the session and tomorrow everything will depend on the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  but I am not expecting big changes," Mikhalyov added. \par \par \uc2  The overnight rouble credit rates fell to 3.00/5.00 percent by 1300 GMT from 8.0/10.0 percent in the early hours of trade. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020020401dy4100koo\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
