\par\par \b \uc2  UPDATE 1- \highlight22\uc2 Russia \highlight\uc2  rouble firms on heavy cbank  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2  By Julie Tolkacheva \par \uc2 489 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 18 Dezember 2001\par 14:50\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2001 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  MOSCOW, Dec 18 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Tuesday carried out one of its heaviest \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  in recent months to help the rouble after a slump that had fuelled concern about the bank's ability to defend the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The rouble firmed slightly against the dollar in key dealings after a 12-kopeck tumble to a fresh low on Monday on concern about lower oil prices. \par \par \uc2  The rouble's weighted average in a unified session of eight exchanges edged up to 30.2769 a dollar from 30.3046. \par \par \uc2  "The only reason for the dollar fall is the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," said Metallinvestbank dealer Alexander Panasenko. \par \par \uc2  Based on the session the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  hiked its official next day rate to 30.28 roubles per dollar from the 30.30. \par \par \uc2  Interbank roubles for tomorrow settlement were also firmer, quoted at 30.2825/30.2925 per dollar by 1335 GMT compared with 30.41/30.42 at the end of Monday trade. \par \par \uc2  Dealers estimated \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  at $300-$550 million on the interbank market, where the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  offered the dollar initially at about 30.41 and later at 30.29. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  declined to comment. \par \par \uc2  Dealers have said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been spending about $100 million a day since mid-November to support the rouble and increased its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to $200-$250 million on Monday. \par \par \uc2  END YEAR VOLATILITY \par \par \uc2  Moscow Narodny Bank dealer Vasily Ushakov said that despite the recent drop he saw no reason to worry about the stability of the rouble. "The market is usually volatile at the end of the year," he said. \par \par \uc2  Bank Zenit chief economist Alexander Karpov added that the market was in the mood to see the rouble move down even further due to higher liquidity. \par \par \uc2  Banks' balances on correspondent accounts at the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  , an indicator of liquidity, rose to 84.57 billion roubles from 71.31 billion roubles on Monday. \par \par \uc2  But dealers said the fate of the rouble depended fully on the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's actions as it maintain its tight control of \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  trade. \par \par \uc2  Panasenko said the rouble could lose another five to eight kopecks to the dollar if the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  left the market. \par \par \uc2  "(But) I think the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will continue to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," Karpov said about the interbank market. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been blamed for a $2.5 billion fall in \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves over two weeks. They were reported at $36.1 billion by the end of the first week in December. \par \par \uc2  However, Troika Dialog chief economist Oleg Vyugin said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was likely to work to maintain gold and \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves at current levels. \par \par \uc2  "The danger of a further decline is minimal, as banks are likely to sell off \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  before end December to ensure salary and tax payments," former first deputy finance minister said in a note to clients. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011218dxci00qv1\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
