\par\par \b \uc2  UPDATE 1-Russia rouble falls past key level, hit by oil. \b0\par\par\uc2  By Julie Tolkacheva \par \uc2 604 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 Dezember 2001\par 14:42\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2001 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  MOSCOW, Dec 7 (Reuters) - The Russian rouble broke through the key psychological level of 30 against the dollar on the interbank market on Friday as the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  finally gave up support of the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  above that level amid weaker oil prices. \par \par \uc2  Roubles for tomorrow delivery stood at 30.0675/30.0775 per dollar at 1320 GMT on the interbank market after 29.9410/29.9510 at Tuesday's close. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  eased only slightly in morning trade, monitored closely by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  as it bases its official rate on this session, but it later broke through 30 on the interbank. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the move had come after the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  removed its offer of 29.95 rouble to the dollar, a rate at which it had supported the national \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the last two weeks. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  heavily to support the national \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the last two weeks at 29.95. Analysts and dealers estimated \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  at $1.5 billion-$2 billion. \par \par \uc2  The spending has come amid falling reserves, down $1.3 billion in the latest week after a big Eurobond repayment, and as banks have lots of free roubles. \par \par \uc2  "If there is no trust below 30 roubles per dollar it eventually becomes very expensive to support it. Basically, speculation made the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  unable to support it at that level," said Peter Westin, a senior economist at Aton. \par \par \uc2  Analysts said the rouble was giving in to lowering prices for oil, Russia's key earner of hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but which has slumped on fears of global recession from around $27 dollars per barrel in early September to around $19 a barrel now. \par \par \uc2  "What we are seeing now is market expectations for a quicker fall of the rouble due to changing prospects for 2002 on the whole and for the trade balance and export revenues," said Yuliya Tseplyayeva, an analyst at ING Barings. \par \par \uc2  PRECIOUS RESERVES \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the rate at the unified session, so called as it brings together eight \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  exchanges across \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2 , had stayed above 30 as the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  with dollar sales of some $70-80 million at 29.9549 roubles per dollar. \par \par \uc2  This allowed the bank to keep the rouble's average rate at the session, which serves as the base for the official next-day rate, at 29.9527 per dollar . \par \par \uc2  This was after a previous 29.9165. Trade volume at the Friday unified session was a high $150 million and the official rate was set at 29.95 roubles per dollar after 29.92 . \par \par \uc2  "People will start to look at the oil price. I believe the rouble will be under new pressure," Westin said. \par \par \uc2  Tseplyayeva also forecast a further fall in the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's reserves, last registered at $37.3 billion as of November 30, down $1.3 billion from the previous week although the bank said this was due to the redemption of a $1 billion Eurobond. \par \par \uc2  "If next week shows a decline again, it will become a significant factor in the rouble's weakening," she said. \par \par \uc2  Dealers and analysts were mixed on whether the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would continue \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but were unanimous in saying the rouble would hold around 30 by the end of the year. \par \par \uc2  Ushakov said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was unlikely to support the rouble on the interbank market above 30. "The way up (for the dollar) is open," Ushakov said, but thought the bank would remain a rouble buyer on the key rate-setting unified session. (Additional reporting by Artyom Danielyan). \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011207dxc700qed\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
