\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Russia \highlight\uc2  cbank sees no need for  \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2 232 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 November 2001\par 15:57\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2001 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  ALMATY, Nov 15 (Reuters) - The head of \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said on Thursday he saw no need to spend foreign reserves on propping up the rouble and that the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  would not fall beyond 30 to the dollar this year. \par \par \uc2  The rouble, which has been depreciating gradually all year as part of government policy, earlier hit year lows against the dollar as markets worried over falls in the oil price, a key revenue earner for Russia. \par \par \uc2  But Russian \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  chief Viktor Gerashchenko, speaking in the Kazakh capital, said he was calm. \par \par \uc2  "I do not think that by the end of the year the (dollar) rate will be higher than 30 roubles, although we will not spend extra \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to hold it within that level," he told reporters. \par \par \uc2  "For us the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserve is more important than a move of the rate above 30 roubles 10 kopecks or 29 roubles 95 kopecks. This is insignificant," he added. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  earlier said its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves were unchanged at $38.5 billion in the week to November 9. \par \par \uc2  The bank set its official exchange rate for Friday at 29.76 to the dollar, the lowest this year. The weakening came on the background of sharply lower oil prices and a row between Russia and OPEC on oil production cuts to support world crude prices. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011115dxbf00qpc\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
