\par\par \b \uc2  Russia rbl slips further but c.bank stems decline. \b0\par\par\uc2 299 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 20 Juli 2001\par 13:41\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2001 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  MOSCOW, July 20 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in rouble markets on Friday after a two-day absence from trade and stemmed a recent tumble that saw the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  hit a string of record lows, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The rouble's weighted average for today settlement edged down to 29.2766 per dollar in a unified session of eight exchanges after 29.2715 per dollar on Thursday. \par \par \uc2  Based as usual on the results of the session, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  set its official rate for the weekend and Monday at a record low of 29.28 per dollar, just down from the previous 29.27 per dollar. \par \par \uc2  "Quotes on the rouble rose to 29.3000/29.3050 per dollar in the morning (on the interbank market)," said Alexander Karpov of Zenit bank. \par \par \uc2  "But then the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  appeared and with its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  it stamped out dollar gains...The bank also appeared in the unified session," he added. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had started selling dollars at 29.3000 roubles per dollar, then later at 29.2950 and 29.2900 roubles per dollar. \par \par \uc2  They said total \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was $20-30 million or more. Overall turnover in the unified session was $106 million on Friday after $90.18 million the day before. \par \par \uc2  Dealers were mixed on forecasts for the rouble over the next week, saying that it chiefly depended on rouble liquidity, which plays a defining role in \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  trade. \par \par \uc2  Rouble liquidity tends to be tighter at the end of the month as bank settle accounts ahead of the start of a new month. \par \par \uc2  By 1110 GMT roubles for next-day delivery were quoted at 29.2700/29.3100 per dollar after a previous average of 29.2924 roubles per dollar. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010720dx7k00cib\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
