\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Russia \highlight\uc2  rbl flat at 28.68/dlr as c.bank  \highlight22\uc2 intervenes \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2 298 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 Februar 2001\par 11:11\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2001 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  MOSCOW, Feb 13 (Reuters) - The Russian rouble stabilised against the dollar on Tuesday after a five-day fall as the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  heavily to extend long-awaited support and dealers said the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  may firm soon. \par \par \uc2  The rouble's weighted average for today settlement at a unified trading session of eight exchanges was little changed at 28.6817 roubles per dollar on Tuesday after a previous 28.6808 per dollar. \par \par \uc2  Based as usual on results of morning trade, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  left its official next day rouble rate unchanged at 28.68 per dollar . \par \par \uc2  "The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  at the 28.70 (roubles per dollar) level, and this means that it will not allow the dollar to rise beyond this level," said a Russian bank dealer. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold about $20-30 million in the unified trading session and focused dollar \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the interbank market, where it sold about $100 million. \par \par \uc2  "The main dollar demand comes from the interbank market, and it is more important for the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to satisfy it... and consequently, demand drops in unified trade," the dealer said. \par \par \uc2  Volume in the unified session slipped to $144.23 million on Tuesday after $147.16 million on Monday. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the rouble was likely to firm to 28.65 per dollar by the end of the week in a market correction after losing 24 kopecks against the dollar since 28.44 last Monday. \par \par \uc2  Roubles for tomorrow delivery were a touch weaker in later trade, quoted at 28.6925/28.7000 per dollar in exchange trading by 1000 GMT after a previous average of 28.6810. \par \par \uc2  Roubles were quoted at 28.6860/28.7060 per dollar on the interbank market . \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010713dx2d06hbl\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
