\par\par \b \uc2  Rouble down to 27.75/dlr despite cbank  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2 254 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 29 August 2000\par 11:03\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2000 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  MOSCOW, Aug 29 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's rouble fell five kopecks against the dollar on Tuesday as dollar short positions were closed, and the slide surprised dealers who said they had expected the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to maintain recent stability. \par \par \uc2  The rouble's weighted average for today settlement at a unified trading session of eight Russian exchanges, usually tightly controlled by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , fell to 27.7549 per dollar from 27.7047 per dollar on Monday. \par \par \uc2  Based as usual on the results of the morning session, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  cut its official next day rate to 27.75 per dollar from Monday's 27.70 . \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had apparently sold about $150 million, which was not enough to satisfy demand. They were reluctant to forecast which way the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  would head next. \par \par \uc2  "The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  several times trying to curb agitated demand for dollars and almost all its bids were gobbled up," said Moskomprivatbank dealer Mikhail Zhirkov. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Chairman Viktor Gerashchenko said last week he did not expect the rouble rate to change sharply in the next several months. \par \par \uc2  "We have been marking time for three weeks and decided on a (dollar) rise today. There were a few more short positions than long ones and today they are equal," a Russian bank dealer said, explaining the reasons behind the move. \par \par \uc2  Roubles for tomorrow settlement had fallen by 0845 GMT to 27.7650/27.7730 after a previous average of 27.7396 . \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010821dw8t09qze\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
