\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Russia \highlight\uc2  rouble up to 28.05/dlr on cbank  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2 238 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 30 Juni 2000\par 12:18\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2000 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  MOSCOW, June 30 (Reuters) - The Russian rouble edged up on Friday, supported by \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  sales in a market awash with roubles, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The rouble's weighted average for today settlement at a unified trading session of eight Russian exchanges, tightly controlled by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , rose to 28.0516 per dollar from 28.0650 per dollar on Thursday. \par \par \uc2  Based as usual on the results of the morning session, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  set its official next day rate at 28.05 roubles per dollar , up from a previous 28.07. \par \par \uc2  Rouble liquidity is high although it is the end of the month and the half-year, when banks and companies pay taxes that usually absorb roubles. \par \par \uc2  "Even after taxes, banks still have a lot of roubles," said Vladimir Sokolov, head of the hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  department at Rosbank. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold about $100 million to push the rouble up, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  "Market participants are in the mood to use some of the rouble to buy hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  which is happening," Sokolov said. \par \par \uc2  He forecast the rouble would weaken next week, to around 28.15. \par \par \uc2  Roubles for tomorrow settlement were firmer in afternoon trade, quoted at 28.0610/28.0650 at 1100 GMT after a previous average of 28.0787 roubles per dollar. ((Julie Tolkacheva, Moscow newsroom, +075 941-8520 moscow.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010820dw6u02gfu\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
