\par\par \b \uc2  UPDATE 1-Russia c.bank head against artificially low rouble. \b0\par\par\uc2 230 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 23 Mai 2000\par 11:29\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2000 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  MOSCOW, May 23 (Reuters) - Russian \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Chairman Viktor Gerashchenko said on Tuesday the rouble should not be artificially weakened to help the government meet budget obligations but should fluctuate smoothly. \par \par \uc2  Gerashchenko was responding to a statement last week by Prime Minister Mikhail Kasyanov that a further strengthening of the rouble was not in the best interests of the economy. \par \par \uc2  "I understand the position of Kasyanov, with his responsibility for the budget, but essentially to finance budget spending by artificially lowering the rouble is ineffective," Gerashchenko told journalists at a bankers' congress. \par \par \uc2  "I am in favour of it (the rouble) moving smoothly, one way and another," he said. \par \par \uc2  Kasyanov's statement had jolted \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, forcing the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  heavily to prevent sharp losses against the dollar, traders said. \par \par \uc2  The rouble has since steadied and was set by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  for Tuesday at 28.30 per dollar after the previous 28.31 per dollar. It had slipped to 28.33 per dollar after Kasyanov's comments. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been supported by strong international prices for Russia's main energy and commodities exports. \par \par \uc2  Exporters are obliged to sell up to 75 percent of hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  earnings. ((Anatoly Vereshchagin, Moscow Newsroom, +7 095 941 8520, moscow.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 2000. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010821dw5n000ye\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
