\par\par \b \uc2  Russian rouble firms to 25.54/dlr in volatile trade. \b0\par\par\uc2      By Karl Emerick Hanuska \par \uc2 482 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 September 1999\par 12:34\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2      MOSCOW, Sept 13 (Reuters) - The Russian rouble firmed on \par \par \uc2  Monday boosted in part by a rogue deal and apparent support from \par \par \uc2  the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , traders said. \par \par \uc2      The rouble averaged 25.5443 per dollar after Friday's \par \par \uc2  25.7036 in the unified session of eight exchanges trading \par \par \uc2  roubles for today settlement, and the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  as usual set \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par its next day rate\tab     at the average, 25.54, after 25.70.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Volume in the session was high at $220.28 million and trade\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par volatile with deals closed in the range 24.5500-25.9999 per\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par dollar.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  "The market opened up softer today, but a short time after\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par trade opened there was a deal for about $20 million at 24.55 per\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par dollar...I think it's fairly clear this was a (technical)\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par mistake by \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  traders," said one Russian dealer.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Officials of the key Moscow Interbank \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  Exchange\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (MICEX) confirmed there had been a deal closed at 24.55 per\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par dollar. \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  officials were unavailable for comment.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The Russian dealer, who said such relatively large deals\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par were usually made by the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , saw the rouble on Tuesday\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par correcting to near its previous level, between 25.70 and 25.80\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par per dollar.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par He said he also saw pressure on the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  after an\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par early-morning bomb blast levelled a suburban Moscow apartment\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par block on Monday, killing at least 34 people.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "There's been no direct effect on the rouble today, but the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par bombing adds trouble to an already uncertain background which\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par has been encouraging investors to switch from roubles and rouble\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par instruments into dollar-related instruments," he said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Renaissance Capital fixed income analyst Parvoleta Shtereva\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par hesitated to attribute the rogue deal to the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  but\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par she said recent high volumes in the unified session were a clear\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par indication the bank had been \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervening\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in trade.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "Volume in trade is far too high right now and there is no\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par reason for it except that the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  is \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervening\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  and\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par that defies logic, especially because of factors like \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Russia\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par positive trade balance," she said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Hard \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  from Russia's trade surplus should be enough\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par to support the rouble but the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  has been easing recently.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Shtereva said \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to boost the rouble\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par amounted to "giving away its reserves" to banks and would only\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par serve to further deplete its foreign \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  stockpile.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     "The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  has either lost the plot or it has some\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par cunning plan that it is getting ready to spring on the market,"\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par she said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The rouble was steady in afternoon trade, quoted by 1010 GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par at 24.7600/24.8111 per dollar\tab     on MICEX's electronic SELT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par    system after a previous average of 25.8022 per dollar.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     ((Moscow Newsroom, +7095 241-0101\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par moscow.newsroom@reuters.com)).\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (C) Reuters Limited 1999.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010907dv9d00tw4\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
