\par\par \b \uc2  Russia G7 Envoy: Ruble Defense Depletes Ctrl Bk Reserves \b0\par\par\uc2 276 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 29 Juli 1999\par 17:06\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  MOSCOW (Dow Jones)--Defending the Russian ruble has dragged down the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's reserves, Russia's envoy to the Group of Seven industrialized nations said Thursday. \par \par \uc2  "The drop of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves is nothing extraordinary," Alexander Livshits told reporters. "The bank used them to keep the ruble stable." \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  reported earlier Thursday that its gold and hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves fell by $500 million in the week to July 23 to $11 billion. That decline brought the fall in reserves to $1.2 billion in the past month. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  refrains from comment on changes of its \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves or on \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The International Monetary Fund requires \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2  to phase out administrative \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  controls by September as a condition for receiving the next tranche of the Fund's $4.5 billion loan which was approved late Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  Asked what controls the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was likely to revoke first, Livshits said: "It could be the requirement for importers to make ruble deposits." \par \par \uc2  Trying to curb capital flight in the spring, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  began forcing importers to make ruble deposits before transferring \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  payments abroad. The deposits, an implicit and heavy tax on imports, are returned only when importers show proof that their goods have arrived in Russia. \par \par \uc2  The measure was designed to discourage the use of false import contracts to export dollars from Russia. \par \par \uc2  Still, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has taken some steps to dismantle other \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  controls. \par \par \uc2  -By Leos Rousek; 7 095 974 8055; lrousek@ap.org \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 29-07-99 \par \par \uc2  1506GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv7t05oq3\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
