\par\par \b \uc2  Russian Ruble Ends Up On  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 280 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 22 Februar 1999\par 16:17\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  MOSCOW (Dow Jones)--The \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2  ruble (RUB) strengthened slightly against the dollar in negligible volumes Monday, as the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  again propped up the ailing local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  On the Moscow Interbank \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  Exchange, the dollar for next-day delivery closed at RUB22.90, down from RUB23.06 Friday. Trading volume declined further to a paltry $22 million, from Friday's $25 million. \par \par \uc2  At the special trading session, restricted to exporters and importers, spot ruble closed at RUB22.90 against the dollar, marginally lower than RUB22.91 Friday. Trading volume totaled $130 million, down from around $150 million Friday. \par \par \uc2  Volumes on that session remained much higher than at the session open to all participants because the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  obliges all exporters to repatriate 75% of their hard-\b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  revenues, a trader with a major Russian bank said. \par \par \uc2  Monday, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  set its dollar rate at RUB22.84, flat from Friday. \par \par \uc2  Sentiment was dormant, a trader with another major Russian bank said. \par \par \uc2  Asked to account for the strengthening of ruble Monday, the trader said: "God only knows. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  made that decision." \par \par \uc2  Volumes are likely to remain low, as traders failed to foresee anything that could perk up the market. Given the low level of activity, even Russia's battered \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will likely be able to keep the ruble in a tight range, the Moscow trader said. \par \par \uc2  "If the volumes remain so small, they'll be able to do that as long as they like," the second Moscow trader said. \par \par \uc2  -By Paivi Munter; 7-095-974-8055; pmunter@ap.org \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 22-02-99 \par \par \uc2  1517GMT \par \par \uc2  1150 1855 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv2m01euu\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
