\par\par \b \uc2  FOCUS-Russian reserves drained to three-year low. \b0\par\par\uc2  By Patrick Lannin \par \uc2 526 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 28 Januar 1999\par 15:25\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  MOSCOW, Jan 28 (Reuters) - Russia's vital foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves have slid to a three-year low of $11.6 billion, and analysts said on Thursday the twin causes were capital flight and payments to service the country's crushing debt. \par \par \uc2  The longer-term fundamental problem remained that people simply wanted to get hold of dollars and out of roubles with the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  forced to keep propping up the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Analysts said reserves may get support from compulsory hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  sales by the country's energy giants. If not, the bank may boost capital controls or change the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  regime. \par \par \uc2  "The number is pretty difficult already now and you are looking at almost half the reserve level being in gold which the bank is probably unlikely to sell," said Erik Nielsen, executive director of emerging markets research at Goldman Sachs. \par \par \uc2  The level of $11.6 billion, recorded on January 22, was a fall from $11.9 billion on January 15. In the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  period, \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2  paid two coupons on its 2005 and 2018 Eurobonds, equal to $320.53 million. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's reserves are becoming the only source of hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  for the government, which is scheduled to make $9.5 billion of debt repayments this year. \par \par \uc2  According to \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  data, the typical size of the gold component is around $4.0 billion, meaning the country has around $7.0 or $8.0 billion in cash reserves. \par \par \uc2  "We would think that if it does not start to pick up a little bit in the next three or four weeks one would have to take a sceptical look at exporters obeying the rules," Nielsen said. \par \par \uc2  To boost reserves, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  ordered exporting companies, chiefly the energy giants such as Gazprom and the oil firms, to repatriate 75 percent of their hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  earnings. \par \par \uc2  The idea is to get some of the cash from the country's huge trade surplus, around $3.0 billion, back into the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Analysts conceded there was a time lag between the order being issued to exporters and cash hitting the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  but said the fact the surplus was so huge and that reserves were still shrinking indicated capital flight. \par \par \uc2  "At least part of the problem and probably the major one is there is greater demand for dollars than their sale. The fundamental reason for that is that capital flight continues at such a phenomenal rate," said Roland Nash, an economist at Moscow's MFK Renaissance. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  did not have many choices if reserves continued to shrink, analysts said. \par \par \uc2  It could stop supporting the rouble and let it depreciate or it could impose an exchange rate, much as in Soviet days when there was an official rate and a black market rate. \par \par \uc2  More capital controls could also be imposed, they said. \par \par \uc2  "I would assume that if they (reserves) fall below 10 or nine billion this would be alarming and maybe even change the exchange rate system," said one analyst. ((Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941-8520 moscow.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1999. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010908dv1s05r1v\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
