\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Russia \highlight\uc2  c.bank to halt wide-scale  \highlight22\uc2 forex intervention \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2 236 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 August 1998\par 15:17\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  MOSCOW, Aug 26 (Reuters) - The Russian \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Wednesday said it would refrain from major \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets because it was virtually the only seller of foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  for roubles. \par \par \uc2  "The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of the Russian Federation does not consider it reasonable to continue to undertake large-scale foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  as it is pratically the only seller of foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the domestic market, which would inevitably lead to a reduction in Russia's reserves," the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said it had spent $8.8 billion in \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets from July to August, while it needed the remaining reserves to meet the urgent needs of the government and to support a minimal level of critical imports. \par \par \uc2  Commercial banks had bought $1.8 billion from the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  since August 17, when Russia announced the suspension of the domestic debt market pending restructuring of short-term debt and a 90-day moratorium on some foreign debt, the bank said. \par \par \uc2  Prime Minister Viktor Chernomyrdin sharply criticised \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  chief Sergei Dubinin for his failure to protect the rouble, which fell five percent against its previous dollar fix on the Moscow Interbank \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  Exchange (MICEX) earlier in the day, and later fell by a third against the mark. \par \par \uc2  ((Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941-8520 moscow.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1998. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020021216du8q01jg8\par }\par \b \uc2 Zusammenfassung der Suche\b0\par \par  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Text\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 (foreign exchange or fx or forex or currenc*) and (interven* or operation*) and (Russia near10 interven*) and (rst=trtw or rst=tprw or rst=tdjw) and (central bank or ministry of finance or treasury ministry or monetary authority)\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 {  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\row } \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Datum\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 01/01/1995 bis 21/08/2023\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 {  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\row } \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\b